---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<LegalPage title="Terms and conditions" description="Terms for booking a taxi, tour or transfer with JC Cabs." draft={false}>
  <h2>Bookings</h2>
  <p>
    A booking is confirmed when JC Cabs confirms it by phone or WhatsApp. Please give accurate pickup, drop, date,
    time and passenger details.
  </p>

  <h2>Fares</h2>
  <p>
    The fare is discussed and agreed with you before booking. Driver bata, toll, parking, night and waiting charges
    are explained in the fare notes on the Fleet &amp; Fares page.
  </p>

  <h2>Cancellations</h2>
  <p>
    Cancel at least 6 hours before pickup for a refund. See our
    <a href="/cancellation-refund-policy" class="underline underline-offset-4">cancellation and refund policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: use the details on the Contact page.</p>
</LegalPage>
